OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 6 MAY
OL,4,G0700FNick Grimshaw
OL,5,     GComedian and Bafta-winning writer
OL,6,     GHolly Walsh joins Nick for a
OL,7,     Gcatch up about her favourite
OL,8,     Gmusic and the new series of
OL,9,     GAmandaland, which she created and
OL,10,     Gco-wrote.
OL,11,G1000FLauren Laverne
OL,12,     GLauren gets your Wednesday going
OL,13,     Gwith the most magnificent music.
OL,14,G1300FChris Hawkins
OL,15,     GIt's what radio was invented
OL,16,     Gfor... that's right, it's Names
OL,17,     Gin Songs! And, you'll get the
OL,18,     Gchance to pick the final song of
OL,19,     Gthe show!
